./governance/review-reports/code-readme-five/r1-外家finder.err:1669:/Users/enzo/.claude/projects/-Users-enzo-harness-lumos-toolchain/26a6b57a-9efc-4073-b845-c27e42a2fbb1.jsonl:13318:{"parentUuid":"da5630d5-336d-476f-bd52-dfeced17e25f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CejdhQz1KQnRHtETuento","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016By6r63cxFKyVzdCpfcFdt","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/enzo/harness/lumos-toolchain; set +e; R=governance/review-reports/code-readme-five; mkdir -p $R\npython3 scripts/lumos loop next code-readme-five --tier standard --orchestrator claude --spec docs/lumos-toolchain-knowledge/Projects/README審視五修_計劃.md 2>&1 | grep -E \"^\\[next\\]|應派\" | cut -c1-140\ngit diff HEAD~1..HEAD -U10 -- scripts governance/daily-governance.sh > $R/r1-snapshot.patch; wc -l $R/r1-snapshot.patch\npython3 scripts/lumos pitfalls --diff HEAD~1..HEAD --no-lint --json > $R/r1-manifest.json 2>/dev/null; python3 -c \"import json;d=json.load(open('$R/r1-manifest.json'));print('claims',len(d['claims']))\"\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nR=\"/Users/enzo/harness/lumos-toolchain/governance/review-reports/code-readme-five\"\njson.dump({\"round\":\"r1\",\"loop\":\"code-readme-five\",\"tier\":\"standard\",\"orchestrator\":\"claude\",\"materials\":[R+\"/r1-snapshot.patch\",R+\"/r1-manifest.json\"],\n \"seats\":[{\"seat\":\"通才\",\"auditor\":\"sonnet\",\"lens\":\"單席通才:全份逐 hunk 挑洞\",\"materials\":[R+\"/r1-snapshot.patch\"]},\n          {\"seat\":\"架構對齊\",\"auditor\":\"sonnet\",\"lens\":\"跟既有寫法一不一致\",\"materials\":[R+\"/r1-snapshot.patch\"]},\n          {\"seat\":\"外家finder\",\"auditor\":\"codex\",\"lens\":\"外家找洞\",\"materials\":[R+\"/r1-snapshot.patch\"]}]},open(R+\"/r1-dispatch.json\",\"w\"),ensure_ascii=False,indent=1)\nprint(\"dispatch written\")\nPY\ncat > $R/r1-外家finder.prompt <<'EOF'\n你是外部第三方 code reviewer,這份 diff 是別人投稿的變更。逐 hunk 讀完、主動找洞;可用 sed/grep/git/python3/bash 查證 repo 真碼(不要改檔)。\nDiff:/Users/enzo/harness/lumos-toolchain/governance/review-reports/code-readme-five/r1-snapshot.patch(git diff -U10)\nrepo:/Users/enzo/harness/lumos-toolchain\n變更主題(五件):①scripts/hooks/pre-commit 與 post-commit 新增 is_shebang_code():沒副檔名的 staged/committed 檔,讀 git 物件首行 #! 是否已知直譯器,是就算程式碼(之前 scripts/lumos 這種主程式從沒被擋);②scripts/hooks/claude/check-graph-sync.py 的收工擋一次改成兩家一致(stop_block_decision 不再看 harness;codex_stop_decision 留相容別名);③governance/daily-governance.sh 自主迴圈段改成 LUMOS_AUTOLOOP=1 才跑;④scripts/lumos enforcement 一句字句;⑤測試 t_code_exts_four_lists_agree 加 shebang 守衛、新測試 t_precommit_shebang_script_counts_as_code、stop-block ⑥ 改成 Claude 也擋。\n鏡頭:①bash 正規表示式 `^#!.*(python|bash|zsh|node|ruby|perl|/sh|[[:space:]]sh)` 的誤判與漏判(例:#!/usr/bin/env -S python3、#!/bin/dash、.gitignore 這種有點的檔、目錄名含點的路徑如 dir.v2/tool、二進位檔首 200 bytes 含 NUL 讓 bash 變數截斷、檔名含空白或換行時 git show \":$path\" 的引號);②`[[ \"${path##*/}\" == *.* ]]` 對 `Makefile.in`/`.env` 的判定是否合理;③pre-commit 在「刪除的檔」(staged deletion)上 git show 失敗→return 1 是否正確不擋;④post-commit 用 HEAD:$path 對 merge commit / 初始 commit 的行為;⑤Claude 側擋一次:Claude Code 的 Stop payload 有 stop_hook_active/session_id/transcript_path 嗎(查 ~/.claude/projects 的逐字稿與官方文件),permission_mode 為 dontAsk/bypass 時 block 會不會被忽略導致名額白燒;⑥LUMOS_AUTOLOOP 預設 0 時 tee -a 寫 log 的路徑存在嗎(logs 目錄若不存在會不會 rc≠0 讓 wrapper 後續段被跳過)。\n紀律:每條 finding 必附從 diff 逐字複製的引句(≥10 字,單行內,格式 引句:「…」)、file: `路徑:行號`、具體失敗場景;blocker/major 必附能當場翻紅的最小重現(指令),附不出標「未能重現」並降權;低嚴重度給不出失敗場景不要標;每條 ≤3 句。\n輸出:逐條 severity: clean|minor|major|blocker 一行、blocking: 是|否 一行、引句行、file 行、場景;乾淨也要一行 severity: clean;最後一行「max severity: X」。\nEOF\n(codex exec --sandbox read-only -C /Users/enzo/harness/lumos-toolchain \"$(cat $R/r1-外家finder.prompt)\" < /dev/null > $R/r1-外家finder.raw 2> $R/r1-外家finder.err; echo \"codex rc=$?\")","description":"Open the standard-tier code loop, freeze the diff snapshot and manifest, write the dispatch record, and launch the Codex external finder","timeout":1500000,"run_in_background":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_